title The long side line
intro A part of the field will glow. Then pick its name.
flip vertical
hide names
hide ball

step
  caption Look at the field. One part will glow yellow.

step
  caption This long line runs all the way down the side.
  draw sideline bottom
  duration 400

question
  prompt What is that called?
  answer Sideline
  wrong Goal line
  wrong Halfway line
  wrong Penalty area
  correct Sideline.
  why The long lines on the sides are the sidelines. If the ball goes over one, it is a throw-in.
